[11/14 16:45:57     13s] #@ Begin verbose flow_step init_mcpu
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 2: # Multi host/cpu attributes
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 3: #-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 4: # The FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS is an environment variable which should be exported by
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 5: # the specified dist script.  This connects the number of CPUs being reserved
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 6: # for batch jobs with the current flow scripts.  The LSB_MAX_NUM_PROCESSORS is
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 7: # a typical environment variable exported by distribution platforms and is
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 8: # useful for ensuring all interactive jobs are using the reserved amount of CPUs.
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 9: if {[info exists ::env(FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS)]} {
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 10: set max_cpus $::env(FLOWTOOL_NUM_CPUS)
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 11: }
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 17: switch -glob {innovus} {
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @@flow 0: set_multi_cpu_usage -verbose -local_cpu   $max_cpus
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] **WARN: (PRL-39):	Number of local CPUs specified (16) > Actual number of CPUs in the host (8). The lower value will be used.
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] set_multi_cpu_usage -local_cpu 8
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 1: if {[get_feature -feature opt_signoff]} {
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 2: if {[is_flow -inside flow:opt_signoff]} {
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @@flow 3: set_multi_cpu_usage -verbose -remote_host         1 -cpu_per_remote_host $max_cpus
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] set_multi_cpu_usage -remote_host 1
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] set_multi_cpu_usage -cpu_per_remote_host 16
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @@flow 4: set_distributed_hosts                             -local
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] The timeout for a remote job to respond is 3600 seconds.
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] Submit command for task runs will be: local
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 5: }
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 6: }
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 7: if {[get_feature -feature sta_eco]} {...}
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] @flow 13: }
[11/14 16:45:57     13s] #@ End verbose flow_step init_mcpu
